<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/17th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Nine Years' War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1688–1697</span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a> · Also known as War of the Grand Alliance, War of the League of Augsburg</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Nine Years' War was fought from 1688 to 1697 between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louis-xiv">Louis XIV</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> and the Grand Alliance led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/william-iii-of-england">William III of England</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch-republic">Dutch Republic</a>, with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-emperor">Holy Roman Emperor</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a> and Savoy. French armies devastated the Palatinate and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhineland">Rhineland</a>, burning <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heidelberg">Heidelberg</a>, Speyer, Worms and many smaller towns in 1689. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-ryswick">Treaty of Ryswick</a> in 1697 ended the war with modest French gains.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/nine-years-war.jpg" alt="Nine Years' War" width="320" height="320" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: DavidDijkgraaf · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Collage_Nine_Years%27_War.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
